spiral waver
==================

Write a function:

    def spiral_waver(size: int) -> list[list[int]]

Build a size x size matrix filled with the numbers 1 .. size*size laid out
in a clockwise spiral that starts at the top-left corner and moves right
first. A size of 0 or less returns an empty list.

Examples:
    spiral_waver(0) -> []
    spiral_waver(-3) -> []
    spiral_waver(1) -> [[1]]
    spiral_waver(2) -> [[1, 2], [4, 3]]
    spiral_waver(3) -> [[1, 2, 3], [8, 9, 4], [7, 6, 5]]
    spiral_waver(4) -> [[1, 2, 3, 4], [12, 13, 14, 5], [11, 16, 15, 6], [10, 9, 8, 7]]
